  "content": "\n\n<p>\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/junyudev/sophisticated-ping/raw/1.19.2/common/src/main/resources/assets/sophisticated_ping/icon.png\" width=\"200\"> \n</p>\n<h1>Sophisticated Ping</h1>\n<p>Minecraft 專用進階訊號輪。讓 MC 重回巔峰！</p>\n<h2>訊號系統</h2>\n<p>預設快捷鍵：<code>c</code></p>\n<p>向隊友發送訊號以進行通訊。</p>\n<p>在訊號點上再次按下快捷鍵即可取消該訊號。</p>\n<h2>圖片</h2>\n<p>隊友發送的訊號：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/junyudev/sophisticated-ping/raw/1.19.2/images/pingFromTeammate.png\" alt=\"pingFromTeammate\"></p>\n<p>夜間訊號：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/junyudev/sophisticated-ping/raw/1.19.2/images/pingAtNight.png\" alt=\"pingAtNight\"></p>",
